An autistic oncologist will say, yes, they can.

00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:58,920
In fact, I just pulled up this article right here that does state, this is from an August 2017 article in this journal that does state that core needle biopsies of breast cancer is associated with a higher rate of distance metastasis 5 to 15 years after diagnosis.

