So, what I mean, think of a biopsy, you know, you're going to go into the core needle biopsy to a breast cancer, they have to go in with the needle and then they're pulling that out and by when they pull it through the other tissue, some cells are being discharged.

00:01:17,420 --> 00:01:23,920
