00:01:24,420 --> 00:01:29,420
The problem is, is that that doesn't mean that you shouldn't get a biopsy.

00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:46,420
So, the truth is, is that the closer the tumor, if it's a breast tumor, the closer it is to the surface, your chance of, you know, causing a metastasis from the biopsy goes way down because you're actually pulling the needle through less tissue.

00:01:46,920 --> 00:02:00,920
If it's a deeper tumor, you know, your chance, you know, will go up because you're pulling the needle through more tissue and you'll be letting more cells go outside of the tissue.

00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:10,920
